            </note>
            <note corresp="#d19-f2" n="69" xml:id="d19-f2-content">
                <p>Joseph Paul-Boncour, French Minister for Foreign Affairs in the Cabinet headed by
                    Léon Blum, March 13–April 10, 1938.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
